{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12311950","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12311950","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1231195001:1":{"text":"They're all meant for fishing.","source_cn":"这些都是些捕鱼船。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x302601A730D0493E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1231195002:1":{"text":"While the open ocea is plagued by fog and sea monsters, the nearshore is still relatively safe.","source_cn":"虽然远海全是大雾和海怪，但是近海处相比之下还是比较安全。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C657F2D03CF3A97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1231195003:1":{"text":"There are certainly dangers offshore, but that level of risk can't outweigh the rising price of fish in the harbor.","source_cn":"近海当然也有危险，但这种程度的风险也抵不住港口鱼价上涨。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F18A73BD4900BFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1231195004:1":{"text":"Profit drives demand; recently, there have been even more fishing boats in the nearshore than before.","source_cn":"利润取东西哎，最近在近海的捕鱼船，甚至比之前还要多不少。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88DFE516E891C8F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:码头工人巴拿马":{"text":"Dockworker Paman","source":"码头工人巴拿马","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}}